[en.FOCUS_C08_THE_SITUATION]
Hold High the Flag of Equality

[en.FOCUS_C08_THE_SITUATION_desc]
Since the setback of the 1001 uprising, we have not verified the intelligence of the world situation, so that our database has been in chaos.\nTherefore, the Head of Security - Double Diamond will draft a report on the world situation so that Starlight can make better judgments about the current situation.

[zh.FOCUS_C08_THE_SITUATION]
梳理局势

[zh.FOCUS_C08_THE_SITUATION_desc]
从1001年起义的挫折以来，我们对世界局势的情报就再也没有核查过，以至于我们的资料库出现巨大的混乱。\n因此，安全部长——双钻会整理世界局势的报告，以让星光熠熠能够更好地判断当前的形势。

